# Trained adapter weights are NEVER committed to this repo.
# The v18 LoRA adapter is a failed artefact (0/18 held-out, never emits
# EOS) and lives only in a Kaggle notebook version output. If a future
# adapter passes the pre-registered kill test, ship it as a GitHub
# Release asset with its evaluation numbers, not in the git tree.
*.safetensors
*.bin
*.pt
*.onnx
